@page "/livery"

<PageTitle>Competition Livery</PageTitle>

<main class="livery-content">
    <!-- Top-Left Back Navigation Button -->
    <div class="livery-header-bar">
        <div class="livery-back-bar">
            <a href="/services" class="back-link">
                <svg class="back-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                    <line x1="19" y1="12" x2="5" y2="12"></line>
                    <polyline points="12 19 5 12 12 5"></polyline>
                </svg>
                <span>Services</span>
            </a>
        </div>

        <!-- Centered Header -->
        <div class="livery-header">
            <h1 class="livery-title">COMPETITION LIVERY</h1>
            <p class="livery-subheading">Professional event horse production and elite management</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    

    <!-- Intro Section: Photo Left, Description Right -->
    <section class="livery-intro">
        <div class="livery-intro__photo-wrapper">
            <img class="livery-intro__photo" src="/images/Services/Livery.jpeg" alt="Ivy Fisher Competition Livery" loading="lazy" />
        </div>
        <div class="livery-intro__copy">
            <h2 class="livery-heading">World-Class Care &amp; Competition Management</h2>
            <p>
                Keep your horse at our yard and let Ivy take care of their training, production and competition campaign. Owners can enjoy watching their horse progress, follow their development and see them compete at events, sharing in every milestone along the way.
            </p>
            <p>
                With excellent facilities, including a large arena, a set of showjumps, incredible off-road hacking and hunt jumps, we provide the ideal environment for producing both young horses and established competition horses. With Ivy’s experience competing and producing horses up to Advanced level, alongside a small, dedicated and reliable team, every horse receives individual care and attention, with their wellbeing and development always our priority.
            </p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Key Benefits Section -->
    <section class="livery-benefits">
        <div class="benefits-header">
            <h3>Why Choose Our Competition Livery</h3>
        </div>

        <div class="benefit-grid">
            <div class="benefit-card">
                <div class="benefit-card__icon">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5">
                        <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline>
                    </svg>
                </div>
                <h4>Experienced Professional Care</h4>
                <p>Your horse is managed directly by international riders and experienced grooms, guaranteeing top-tier daily management.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="benefit-card">
                <div class="benefit-card__icon">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5">
                        <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline>
                    </svg>
                </div>
                <h4>Individualized Fitness &amp; Training</h4>
                <p>Custom training programs tailored to your horse’s specific stage of development, fitness goals, and competition schedule.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="benefit-card">
                <div class="benefit-card__icon">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5">
                        <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline>
                    </svg>
                </div>
                <h4>First-Class Facilities</h4>
                <p>Full access to our Monarch stables, horse walker, lunge pen, 60x45m arena, and extensive off-road hacking in Leicestershire.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="benefit-card">
                <div class="benefit-card__icon">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5">
                        <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline>
                    </svg>
                </div>
                <h4>Owner Involvement &amp; Peace of Mind</h4>
                <p>Owners are always welcome at the yard to watch training, enjoy competition days, and receive detailed progress updates.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
</main>

<SiteFooter />